      "heading": "题目描述",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>输入一个整数 <span class=\"katex math inline\">n</span>，打印 <span class=\"katex math inline\">n</span> 行的字母直角。</p>\n<p>比如，假设 <span class=\"katex math inline\">n=3</span>，那么打印 <span class=\"katex math inline\">3</span> 行的字母直角如下：</p>\n<pre><code>A\nBB\nCCC\n</code></pre>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "输入一个整数 n，打印 n 行的字母直角。\n比如，假设 n=3，那么打印 3 行的字母直角如下：\nA\nBB\nCCC"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输入",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>一个整数 <span class=\"katex math inline\">n</span>。（<span class=\"katex math inline\">0 &lt; n &lt; 10</span>）</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "一个整数 n。（0 < n < 10）"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输出",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p><span class=\"katex math inline\">n</span> 行的字符直角。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "n 行的字符直角。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "样例",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"sample-test\">\n                        <div class=\"input\">\n                            <h4>输入</h4>\n                            <pre>3</pre>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"output\">\n                            <h4>输出</h4>\n                            <pre>A\r\nBB\r\nCCC</pre>\n                        </div>\n\n                        \n                                            </div>\n                </div>",
      "text": "输入\n                            3\n                        \n                        \n                            输出\n                            A\r\nBB\r\nCCC"
